# Ringside

Ringside is an in-play betting exchange that can't be courtsided: the fight and the order book live in the same MagicBlock rollup, so every price is as fresh as the last punch.

Same bot, same {{headline.n_matches}} held-out matches, {{headline.delay_ms:s}} s TV delay: the courtsider made **{{headline.courtsider_pnl_per_match_tv:+.2f}}** per match on the delayed book and **{{headline.courtsider_pnl_per_match_ringside:+.2f}}** on Ringside, where {{headline.stale_rejections_ringside}} of its stale orders were rejected onchain and {{headline.stale_fills_accepted_ringside}} filled. Measured on {{network}}.

